# =============================================================================
# Adversarial Geopolitical Risk Agent -- .gitignore
# Rationale: this repo holds code (notebooks) only. Raw data, generated
# artifacts, model caches, secrets and editor/OS noise stay out of git.
# =============================================================================

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 1. Project data (large, re-creatable, possibly licensed)
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw inputs: gdelt_YYYY-MM.csv (13 months, ~4.9M rows), vessel_full_history.csv,
# fundamentals_full.csv. Keep them outside the repo or in these folders.
csv_backfill/
data/
raw/
datasets/

# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# 2. Generated pipeline outputs
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Every notebook writes to an `outputs/` folder (rag matrix, vectorizer, episode
# files, Hawk/Dove JSON, unified feed, alerts, LLM call cache, full-text cache).
# `outputs/*` (not `outputs/`) so the placeholder below can be re-included.
**/outputs/*
!**/outputs/.gitkeep

# Optional: small, human-readable deliverables you may WANT to version.
# Uncomment to track them (the glob above ignores them by default).
# !**/outputs/step5_final_calibrated_config.json
# !**/outputs/disruption_alerts.csv
# !**/outputs/step5_threshold_sweep.csv

# Caches that could sit outside outputs/ if a path is changed in a Config cell
step4_cache/
fulltext_cache/

